{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TH","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","commonName":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","title":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","order":52,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"7b779bb57cdb15502b32872ce7115f34d550b7e02fcb8944aaa603955206b944","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TH/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":89},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我们既不能再忍，就愿意独自等在雅典，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["打发我们的兄弟在基督福音上作 神执事的",{"noteId":0},"提摩太前去，坚固你们，并在你们所信的道上劝慰你们，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["免得有人被诸般患难摇动。因为你们自己知道，我们受患难原是命定的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我们在你们那里的时候，预先告诉你们，我们必受患难，以后果然应验了，你们也知道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["为此，我既不能再忍，就打发人去，要晓得你们的信心如何，恐怕那诱惑人的到底诱惑了你们，叫我们的劳苦归于徒然。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但提摩太刚才从你们那里回来，将你们信心和爱心的好消息报给我们，又说你们常常记念我们，切切地想见我们，如同我们想见你们一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["所以，弟兄们，我们在一切困苦患难之中，因着你们的信心就得了安慰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你们若靠主站立得稳，我们就活了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我们在 神面前，因着你们甚是喜乐；为这一切喜乐，可用何等的感谢为你们报答 神呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我们昼夜切切地祈求，要见你们的面，补满你们信心的不足。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["愿 神—我们的父和我们的主耶稣一直引领我们到你们那里去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["又愿主叫你们彼此相爱的心，并爱众人的心都能增长，充足，如同我们爱你们一样，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["好使你们当我们主耶稣同他众圣徒来的时候，在我们父 神面前，心里坚固，成为圣洁，无可责备。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"作 神执事的：有古卷是与 神同工的","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TH/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TH/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TH/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}